{
  "quest.3C2D0FF5070F4CA0.quest_desc": [
    "Hydra fangs make arrows that poison the target and heal you as they hit.",
    "",
    "The hydra also has a rare drop, the &aHydra Heart&r. Kept in your hotbar, it gives regeneration that gets stronger the more hurt you are.",
  ],
  "quest.59D1CB72B49F8A64.quest_desc": [
    "Once your dragon reaches stage 3 you can brush it for scales. Each brushing drops one or two.",
    "",
    "A dragon allows as many brushings as its stage number, so a stage 3 dragon gives three. Every Dragon Meal you feed it restores one.",
  ],
  "quest.5CB0CACC6679613C.title": "&6Dragonsteel Weapons",
  "quest.21419B5F4A9B8F52.title": "&bTide Trident",
  "task.5A07CBC8CAADEAD4.title": "Any Dragonsteel Dragon Armor",
  "quest.1E7EAA3C72E9575D.title": "&bDragon Bone Flute",
  "quest.3145BAAC2B937721.quest_desc": [
    "Death worms rarely drop an egg. Throw it and it hatches into a small worm that's on your side.",
    "",
    "A tamed worm doesn't take orders. It stays near where it hatched, attacks hostile mobs and leaves you and your animals alone. A &cGiant Death Worm Egg&r hatches one four times the size.",
  ],
  "quest.59D1CB72B49F8A64.title": "&aScales Without a Fight",
  "quest.7298DEADC14C0ECB.quest_desc": [
    "With 10 base damage, five times a normal arrow, Dragon Bone Arrows are worth the Witherbone Shards they cost.",
    "",
    "They're the safest way to soften up a dragon before it gets close enough to breathe on you.",
  ],
  "quest.28BA1DC94EFADB96.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click your dragon with the staff to switch it between wandering, staying and escorting you.",
    "",
    "Sneak and right-click to set a home point where the dragon stands, and it keeps within 40 blocks of that spot. Do it again to clear the home.",
    "",
    "The staff takes a dragon skull, which comes with the last harvest of a body.",
  ],
  "quest.2D6E3B320DCEA94C.title": "&6Dragonsteel Dragon Armor",
  "task.4291599847A334E8.title": "Any Lightning Dragon Egg",
  "quest.50FBC8CB0EC453E1.title": "&dBreeding Dragons",
  "quest.23AF36E017614FD2.title": "&aGrowing a Dragon",
  "quest.6DF54549C3A1524E.title": "&dLightning Eggs",
  "task.1FF7100948FDC0BA.title": "Any Pixie Jar",
  "quest.3C7FAE85D409147E.quest_desc": [
    "Cockatrices guard chickens in savannas, and their stare withers whatever they lock eyes with.",
    "",
    "Stare back to break one. Look at it in short bursts so the wither doesn't kill you, and keep going until it gives up. A tamed cockatrice fights for you, heals on seeds and switches between sitting, following and patrolling when you right-click it.",
  ],
  "quest.2D6E3B320DCEA94C.quest_desc": [
    "The top tier of armor for your dragon. Every dragon armor is made from blocks, not ingots, so a full dragonsteel set takes a lot of forging.",
  ],
  "quest.3C7FAE85D409147E.title": "&aCockatrices",
  "task.67C29D0F495C864B.title": "Any Dragon Bone Tool",
  "quest.581254729749E4EF.title": "&dPhantasmal Blade",
  "task.1818416AF26AB403.title": "Any Dragonsteel Chestplate",
  "quest.68F97A93A23A89C3.title": "&6Dragon Scale Armor",
  "quest.74BC8197519FD53C.quest_desc": [
    "A full set of dragonsteel gives 34 armor points and 6 toughness per piece, with the same extra breath protection as scale armor.",
    "",
    "The chestplate alone has 2,560 durability.",
  ],
  "quest.1E9094CDA403E860.title": "&dPixies",
  "quest.606BCC9928F72DB4.quest_desc": [
    "Set the egg on netherrack and light the netherrack, so the egg sits inside the flames. Fire can't hurt a fire egg.",
    "",
    "It hatches after 7,200 ticks (six minutes) of burning. If the fire goes out, the count pauses until you light it again.",
  ],
  "quest.416EBE0C6067825E.quest_desc": [
    "Trolls are rare, and they spawn underground beneath forests, hills, mountains and snowy biomes. Arrows can't hurt them, so fight them up close. Sunlight turns a troll to stone, but a stone troll drops nothing.",
    "",
    "Troll weapons don't drop in this pack, only their hides and tusks. A full set of troll leather armor cuts projectile damage by 70%.",
  ],
  "quest.2A8D69C741D33C49.quest_desc": [
    "The &aCore&r is the forge's center block, and it needs a &3Dragon Heart&r of the matching element. Each dragon body gives only one heart.",
    "",
    "The &aAperture&r is the opening the dragon breathes into. All three parts of a forge must share one element.",
  ],
  "task.6CF0F483D75B678A.title": "Any Dragon Armor",
  "quest.416EBE0C6067825E.title": "&7Troll Leather Armor",
  "task.2168DB0283CCD4AF.title": "Any Blood-Infused Sword",
  "quest.78871F87322B3441.quest_desc": [
    "These are the first tier of dragon gear. The Dragon Bone Sword matters most, since both the blood-infused swords and the Phantasmal Blade start from one.",
  ],
  "quest.16D85C047B6EC329.title": "&cDragonforge Bricks",
  "quest.421C1C23DAD7CFBF.title": "&cPowering the Forge",
  "quest.43FF2B6CBA021F30.title": "&6Dragonsteel",
  "task.160B4DB3DD6D2545.title": "Any Death Worm Chitin Chestplate",
  "quest.199022E0BC1A489E.quest_desc": [
    "&eIce and Fire&r fills the world with dragons and mythical creatures. This chapter covers finding and fighting them, and this chapter picks up from there. It covers raising your own dragon, forging dragonsteel, and the gear the other creatures drop.",
    "",
    "The &aBestiary&r is the mod's own guide, and it grows as you add &2Manuscripts&r to it. Manuscripts turn up in dragon hoards, monster lairs and graveyard chests.",
    "",
    "&7&oWild dragons can't break blocks inside claimed chunks unless your team allows mob griefing in its claim settings. Tamed dragons never break blocks.",
  ],
  "quest.1EF208E4A6356FB2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"Tide Guardian armor needs sea serpent scales and the \", {\"text\": \"Shiny Scales\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \" a hippocampus drops when killed. The \", {\"text\": \"Sea Serpents quest\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"269CA7E3614C0826\", \"page\": 1}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": {\"text\": \"Go to quest\"}}}, \" in the Exploration chapter covers the hunt.\"]",
    "",
    "Wearing every piece gives Water Breathing, and each individual piece adds more Strength while you're in water or rain.",
  ],
  "task.22A76FF0060CCC9A.title": "Any Ice Dragon Egg",
  "quest.2904099C745CCF6F.quest_desc": [
    "Death worms tunnel through desert sand and lash out with their tongues. They come in tan, white and red, and their chitin makes armor with extra toughness.",
    "",
    "Their tongues make the &aDeath Worm Gauntlet&r, which lashes a target for 3 damage and pulls it to you.",
  ],
  "quest.1E7EAA3C72E9575D.quest_desc": [
    "Play the flute to call every tamed dragon, hippogryph and amphithere within 128 blocks down to the ground.",
    "",
    "Keep one on you whenever you fly. A dragon that wanders off into the sky is hard to get back without it.",
  ],
  "quest.7B8CB30F669E60EC.title": "&cBuilding the Forge",
  "quest.23AF36E017614FD2.quest_desc": [
    "A dragon ages one day for every full in-game day it spends loaded, and each &aDragon Meal&r adds another day on top. A meal also fills 20 hunger and heals it.",
    "",
    "Any meat fills its hunger between meals, and ice dragons eat fish too. A &aSickly Dragon Meal&r stops a dragon aging until it gets a normal meal again.",
    "",
    "Stages breakdown on the next page ->",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "- &aStage 1, day 0&r: bites only. Right-click it with an empty hand and it rides on you, up to three at once.",
    "- &2Stage 2, day 25&r: weak breath.",
    "- &aStage 3, day 50&r: big enough to ride, and gains a charge attack.",
    "- &2Stage 4, day 75&r: adult, and able to breed.",
    "- &aStage 5, day 100&r: the largest and rarest. Tamed dragons stop growing at day 128.",
  ],
  "quest.61BBA4CF0F6E67CA.title": "&7Silver Weapons",
  "quest.46068E2E32224447.title": "&dPixie Wand",
  "task.294D4AB9D12DED49.title": "Any Dragonsteel Ingot",
  "quest.2904099C745CCF6F.title": "&6Death Worm Chitin",
  "task.6CFEF7AF3748B929.title": "Any Tide Guardian Chestplate",
  "quest.1EF208E4A6356FB2.title": "&bTide Guardian Armor",
  "task.25B0EFE0B3192DFC.title": "Any Dragonforge Core",
  "quest.607D6416DFF2633D.quest_desc": [
    "Blood from a dragon gives a Dragon Bone Sword that dragon's element, and each element hits another dragon type harder.",
    "",
    "- &cFlamed&r: sets targets on fire and knocks them back. +8 damage against ice dragons.",
    "- &bIced&r: freezes targets. +8 damage against fire dragons.",
    "- &dLightning&r: strikes targets with lightning. +4 damage against fire and ice dragons.",
  ],
  "quest.4166A19810245A35.quest_desc": [
    "At stage 3 a dragon is big enough to carry you. Right-click it with an empty hand to climb on.",
    "",
    "- &bJump&r: take off.",
    "- &bX&r: fly down.",
    "- &bR&r: breathe.",
    "- &bG&r: strike.",
    "- &bF7&r: switch the camera.",
    "",
    "Those are the default keys, and you can change them in Controls. Sneak and right-click with an empty hand to open the dragon's inventory, where its armor goes.",
  ],
  "quest.74E84C98BFE95FDC.quest_desc": [
    "An ice egg has to sit in water. Place it in a water block and it soon freezes solid into a &bFrozen Dragon Egg&r.",
    "",
    "The frozen egg hatches 7,200 ticks (six minutes) after it froze. Leave the block alone until then.",
  ],
  "task.24661216C039A688.title": "Any Dragon Scale Chestplate",
  "quest.78871F87322B3441.title": "&6Dragon Bone Tools",
  "quest.74BC8197519FD53C.title": "&6Dragonsteel Armor",
  "quest.28BA1DC94EFADB96.title": "&6Dragon Command Staff",
  "quest.7B1C963DF16730CC.quest_desc": [
    "Amphitheres fly over jungles. Shoot one down with a bow, climb on before it takes off again, and stay on for 20 seconds while it bites at you. Good armor helps.",
    "",
    "A tamed amphithere is one of the fastest mounts in the mod. Look up to climb and down to dive, and breed them with cookies. Their feathers make &aAmphithere Arrows&r, which knock mobs back with a gust of wind.",
  ],
  "quest.607D6416DFF2633D.title": "&cBlood-Infused Swords",
  "task.7FB13EF06038583C.title": "Any Dragonforge Aperture",
  "quest.20ED696F76AE2271.title": "&dSummoning Crystal",
  "quest.40E7F09D3A6B013E.quest_desc": [
    "The lectern adds pages to your Bestiary. Put the book in the left slot and manuscripts in the bottom slot, and each manuscript unlocks one more page.",
    "",
    "Those pages cover where each creature in this part of the chapter lives, what it drops and how to tame the ones that can be tamed.",
  ],
  "task.4245160F4EED1CDD.title": "Any Fire Dragon Egg",
  "quest.3A7D120D05FE0839.quest_desc": [
    "Hippocampi are rare, harmless sea creatures that swim in oceans. Feed one kelp, and each piece has a one in three chance to tame it.",
    "",
    "A tamed hippocampus takes a saddle, horse armor and a chest, and it swims far faster than it walks. Prismarine crystals breed them.",
  ],
  "quest.193816470731136F.title": "&6Scales and Bones",
  "quest.3BC9C46AD0D3E05E.quest_desc": [
    "Adult females, the stage 4 and 5 dragons that sleep in dragon caves, always give an egg along with their heart when you harvest them. Younger females drop one only rarely.",
    "",
    "The egg's color sets the element:",
    "- &cFire&r: red, green, bronze and gray.",
    "- &bIce&r: blue, white, sapphire and silver.",
    "- &dLightning&r: electric, amethyst, copper and black.",
    "",
    "Place the egg yourself. The hatchling tamed is bound to whoever placed it.",
  ],
  "task.5AA1487454ADA13C.title": "Tame a Hippocampus",
  "task.2742F4B89D60D68E.title": "Dragonforge Bricks",
  "task.34EAE68FB9C3D3FB.title": "Any Dragon Egg",
  "quest.46068E2E32224447.quest_desc": [
    "The wand fires a charge that deals 5 damage and lifts the target into the air, using Pixie Dust as ammunition.",
    "",
    "Its &aPixie Wings&r are a rare drop from pixies.",
  ],
  "quest.199022E0BC1A489E.title": "&6Ice and Fire",
  "quest.542B48C91528377D.title": "&6Dragon Horn",
  "quest.219138696B238587.quest_desc": [
    "Hippogryphs roam hills and mountains and attack anything smaller than they are, you included. Drop rabbit feet near one until it lies down, and it's yours.",
    "",
    "Sneak and right-click it to fit a saddle, a chest or &aHippogryph Armor&r. A stick switches it between sitting and wandering, and rabbit stew breeds two of them.",
  ],
  "task.2CD04B5475FDB41C.title": "Tame an Amphithere",
  "quest.1E9094CDA403E860.quest_desc": [
    "Pixie villages sit in forests and jungles. Pixies in this pack don't steal from you.",
    "",
    "Right-click a pixie with an empty &aJar&r to catch it. A jarred pixie makes one &dPixie Dust&r per in-game day and holds it until you right-click the jar with an empty hand.",
    "",
    "Cake dropped near a wild pixie befriends it instead. A befriended pixie follows you and gives you an effect based on its color.",
  ],
  "quest.581254729749E4EF.quest_desc": [
    "Ghosts haunt graveyards at night, and arrows and fire pass straight through them. Bring your silver sword.",
    "",
    "They sometimes drop a &aPhantasmal Ingot&r, the key part of the Phantasmal Blade. The blade fires spinning ghost swords that fly through blocks.",
  ],
  "quest.7298DEADC14C0ECB.title": "&6Dragon Bone Bow",
  "quest.6DF54549C3A1524E.quest_desc": [
    "Lightning eggs need open sky and rain. Place the egg outside with nothing above it and wait for the weather to turn.",
    "",
    "Time only counts while rain falls on it, 7,200 ticks (six minutes) in total. Deserts, savannas and badlands never see rain, so carry the egg out of them first.",
  ],
  "quest.5CB0CACC6679613C.quest_desc": [
    "Dragonsteel weapons keep the element they were forged with.",
    "",
    "- &cFire&r: sets targets on fire for 15 seconds and knocks them back.",
    "- &bIce&r: freezes targets inside a block of ice.",
    "- &dLightning&r: arcs from the target to up to 10 nearby mobs you can see, losing half its damage with each jump.",
  ],
  "quest.50FBC8CB0EC453E1.quest_desc": [
    "A male and a female of the same element, both stage 4 or older, can breed. Feed each of them the matching &aLily Mixture&r, and the female lays a single egg.",
    "",
    "Fire, Frost and Lightning Lilies grow wild in the same biomes as the matching dragon's roosts.",
  ],
  "quest.68F97A93A23A89C3.quest_desc": [
    "Scale armor takes the color of the scales it was made from, and every piece gives extra protection against dragon breath.",
    "",
    "Wear a full set before you go into a dragon cave. Cave dragons are older and far tougher than anything in a roost.",
  ],
  "task.41694B451EB8EF5D.title": "Tame a Hippogryph",
  "quest.20ED696F76AE2271.quest_desc": [
    "Bind a crystal by right-clicking your dragon with one of the same element. Using the bound crystal anywhere in that dimension teleports the dragon to you.",
    "",
    "It finds the dragon even after its chunk unloads. Crafting the bound crystal on its own clears the binding.",
  ],
  "quest.219138696B238587.title": "&aHippogryphs",
  "quest.43FF2B6CBA021F30.quest_desc": [
    "Iron and the matching dragon blood turn into &6Dragonsteel&r in a running forge. Anything the forge can't process burns to ash or freezes into dragon ice, so check JEI before you load it.",
    "",
    "Short on blood? A forge also fills a glass bottle with its own element's blood from that element's scales.",
  ],
  "quest.606BCC9928F72DB4.title": "&cFire Eggs",
  "quest.3145BAAC2B937721.title": "&6Death Worm Egg",
  "quest.61BBA4CF0F6E67CA.quest_desc": [
    "Silver tools and weapons deal +2 damage to undead. Every mod's silver counts as the same metal here, so any silver ingot works.",
  ],
  "quest.2F9ED8F13B212606.title": "&7Witherbone",
  "quest.4166A19810245A35.title": "&aTaking Flight",
  "quest.5F04C8F8D8DC7A89.title": "&aSheep Disguise",
  "quest.2A8D69C741D33C49.title": "&cCore and Aperture",
  "task.492DCC85FC641D92.title": "Any Dragonsteel Sword or Axe",
  "quest.40E7F09D3A6B013E.title": "&aBestiary Lectern",
  "quest.3BACBE2AA1E0DB47.title": "&bDragon Armor",
  "task.1749F873BB9B1692.title": "Any Summoning Crystal",
  "quest.2F9ED8F13B212606.quest_desc": [
    "Witherbone takes the place of sticks in every dragon bone tool and weapon.",
    "",
    "- &aWither Skeletons&r: drops up to one each, but only when you kill them with melee.",
    "- &2Cockatrices&r: drops up to two each, and they spawn in savannas.",
  ],
  "quest.16D85C047B6EC329.quest_desc": [
    "A &cDragonforge&r uses a live dragon's breath to make the strongest metal in the mod. Fire, ice and lightning each have their own forge, and the bricks decide which one you're building.",
    "",
    "One forge takes 17 bricks of the same element. The bricks are made with blocks of dragon scales, so a forge uses a lot of scales.",
  ],
  "quest.542B48C91528377D.quest_desc": [
    "Use an empty horn on one of your dragons to store it inside. Use the horn on a block to let the dragon out again.",
    "",
    "A full-grown dragon is hard to walk anywhere, so this is the easy way to move one between bases.",
  ],
  "quest.193816470731136F.quest_desc": [
    "[ \"Harvest a dragon's body for its scales and bones. The \", { \"text\": \"Harvesting a Dragon\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"250945907CE6EA9D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"value\":{\"translate\":\"Go to Quest\"},\"action\":\"show_text\"} }, \" quest explains how to do this.\"]",
    "",
    "- &aScales&r: armor for you, and the bricks of a Dragonforge.",
    "- &2Bones&r: tools, weapons, arrows and the instruments that control a tamed dragon.",
    "",
    "Keep every &3Dragon Heart&r and bottle of blood as well. The &dDragonforge&r needs both.",
  ],
  "task.56CDA4231D09673D.title": "Any Dragon Scales",
  "task.3EFFA8F128E60783.title": "Tame a Cockatrice",
  "quest.3BC9C46AD0D3E05E.title": "&6Dragon Eggs",
  "quest.7B1C963DF16730CC.title": "&aAmphitheres",
  "task.544B68CBF25BAEC1.title": "Any Lily Mixture",
  "quest.3BACBE2AA1E0DB47.quest_desc": [
    "Dragon armor comes in four pieces, for the head, neck, body and tail. Each goes in its own slot in the dragon's inventory.",
    "",
    "It comes in iron, copper, silver, gold, diamond, netherite and dragonsteel. The silver set takes any Block of Silver.",
  ],
  "quest.3C2D0FF5070F4CA0.title": "&aHydra Arrows",
  "quest.5F04C8F8D8DC7A89.quest_desc": [
    "Wear the full disguise and sneak, and a cyclops can barely see you. It's the safest way to walk past one to reach its hoard.",
  ],
  "quest.74E84C98BFE95FDC.title": "&bIce Eggs",
  "quest.21419B5F4A9B8F52.quest_desc": [
    "The Tide Trident hits much harder than a vanilla trident and pierces through several enemies in one throw.",
    "",
    "Sea serpent fangs also make &aTide Arrows&r, which keep their speed underwater instead of slowing down.",
  ],
  "quest.7B8CB30F669E60EC.quest_desc": [
    "The forge is a 3x3x3 cube, built one layer at a time.",
    "",
    "- &aBottom and top layers&r: Blocks of Dragon Bones on the four corners, bricks on the other five spots.",
    "- &aMiddle layer&r: the Core in the center, the Aperture in the middle of one side, bricks everywhere else.",
    "",
    "Leave open ground in front of the Aperture. The dragon has to stand there.",
  ],
  "task.3ACB0049F0E9DBD5.title": "Any Troll Leather Chestplate",
  "quest.421C1C23DAD7CFBF.quest_desc": [
    "A forge only runs while a dragon of its element breathes into the Aperture. Keep a tamed dragon in front of it, or chain a wild one there.",
    "",
    "A &aChain Line&r ties a mob to a wall block and can't be broken. Dragons break most walls, though, so tie them to a &aDragon Bone Wall&r.",
    "",
    "The dragon keeps breathing for as long as the forge holds something it can process.",
  ],
  "quest.3A7D120D05FE0839.title": "&bHippocampi",
}